            "review_title": "Review at Sher E Punjab",
            "review_text": "Tony Weston\nWorcester, United Kingdom122 contributions\n0\nFabulous ‘Street Food’ Indian restaurant\nMar 2024 • Family\nCan’t believe that I’m the second reviewer in Trip Advisor for this fabulous ‘street food’ Indian restaurant. \n\nI’ve been to many Indian restaurants across the world, and this is top-notch, with great service. \n\nYou’ll do your tastebuds a disservice if you walk past, and don’t enjoy this gastronomic delight too. And it was very cheap too! Enjoy\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2024",
